.TH OPJ_JP3D_DECOMPRESS 1 "2026-02-21" "OpenJP3D 0.1.0" "OpenJP3D Manual"
.SH NAME
opj_jp3d_decompress \- decode a JP3D codestream into a raw binary volume
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B opj_jp3d_decompress
.RB [ \-h ]
.RB [ \-\-version ]
.RB [ \-v ]
.RB \-i\ \fIinput.jp3d\fR
.RB \-o\ \fIoutput.raw\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B opj_jp3d_decompress
reads a JP3D (JPEG\ 2000 Part\ 10) codestream file and decodes it into a
raw binary volume. Samples are written in z\-major order, little-endian.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-i\ \fIfile\fR
Input JP3D codestream file (required).
.TP
.BR \-o\ \fIfile\fR
Output raw binary volume file (required).
.TP
.BR \-v
Verbose output.
.TP
.BR \-h ,\ \-\-help
Print help message and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Print version information and exit.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
opj_jp3d_decompress \-i volume.jp3d \-o volume.raw
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR opj_jp3d_compress (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_dump (1),
.BR opj_jp3d_transcode (1)
